      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Burnout is a very real possibility, as chronic stress can severely impact cognitive function. To potentially help clear the fog at home, try making small, consistent changes to your routine. Prioritize getting consistent, quality sleep, staying well-hydrated, and incorporating short breaks for mindfulness or gentle movement throughout your busy days. Remember that managing stress is a proactive step toward supporting your brain health.",
